  <item>
    <title>抱着疙瘩汤上树：《漫长的季节》与我们眼中的东北</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646e823e53a5e5ea14fd6b6a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646e823e53a5e5ea14fd6b6a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 May 2023 21:31:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是嘎拉哈的第一期节目，嘎拉哈是来自满族的一种民间游戏，由牛、羊、猪等牲畜的膝盖骨制成，配合沙包一起使用。我们是一档文艺类播客，每期会分享不同的主题，集中于文艺作品的解读。希望我们能在游戏中习得。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 剧情解读 彪子与包法利先生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 抱着疙瘩汤上树</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4290">71:30</a>《东北游记》与东北的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> &nbsp;东北气质的艺术作品 老彼得·勃鲁盖尔和王广义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5010">83:30</a> 再回首or向前看</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZeHy5SEEYK8tcvbVfvSqxit_Dy.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>凝固北方的极地28号 &nbsp;&nbsp;王广义</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCwSOWV4omgey2gN79AL3l02X_F.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大批判——艺术和权利 &nbsp;&nbsp;王广义</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmEKGnvY4En98iOi2bABdrwJGYDD.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hunters in the snow (雪中猎人） &nbsp;Pieter Bruegel the Elder（老彼得·布鲁盖尔）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnBM790Hygb-PJ6wJoQAuqdERbMJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>The wedding Dance in the open air （农民的舞蹈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pieter Bruegel the Elder（老彼得·布鲁盖尔）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknSUi-OLgMHG_aNYaEiZ2OASgpL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Portrait of a woman (吉普赛女郎） Frans Hals (弗兰斯·哈尔斯）</span></p>]]></description>
